    pub allow_log_reversion: Option<bool>,

    /// Whether a former leader immediately starts a new election on restart.
    ///
    /// When enabled (the default), a node with its own committed vote campaigns in
    /// the next term at startup, even when election timers are disabled. It must
    /// obtain a quorum before serving writes, and appends a blank entry in the new
    /// term when elected. This prevents reusing log ids after losing unflushed logs.
    ///
    /// When disabled, the node starts as a follower (or learner), preserving its
